"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:bac76b4016c0bbd0a5985456193dbe18700298ff076cd75962a03bb8f037b3ac","title":"Can wedge holography be constructed with a de Sitter bulk and de Sitter gravitating branes, and can suitable arrangements and gluing of those branes model universes or multiverses capable of exchanging information?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0087"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:ba6b6174155db38b41214e5c3f99fa2493ce25ff20621535f6f9511c17f5c1d9","title":"How general and persistent is matter-to-radiation cosmological stasis across the full space of species decay rates and initial abundances, and which spectra favor longer duration beyond previously studied power-law models?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0089"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:baf5b11de656141f091e3a9ae923ffbeba5dd3907b228fd39ec931fe896b7847","title":"How can generalized Komar charges and other surface charges constrain gravitational solitons and boson stars, and how do matter fields invariant under combined spacetime and global transformations modify these constraints and black-hole Smarr formulas?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0090"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:bafc4b56732941e2a932db04d2397cd6650889120d1309550cb23ff4059e06f8","title":"Does the Goon–Penco entropy–extremality response relation extend to higher-dimensional de Sitter black holes, to approaches along either horizon toward both mass endpoints, and to ensembles allowing charge and angular momentum to shift with the perturbation?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0095"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:bacd3cc227811e470b2653ee1d64dbdf2ad5881e7b022296b5fdd5b88aa49305","title":"How do anomaly cancellation, unitarity, the AdS distance conjecture and landscape finiteness constrain Ad